{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-17-1","title":"Jeremiah 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The captivity of Judah for her sin. 5 Trust in man is cursed; 7 in God is blessed. 9 The deceitful heart cannot deceive God. 12 The salvation of God. 15 The prophet complains of the mockers of his prophecy. 19 He is sent to renew the covenant in hallowing the sabbath.</p>\n<p>written. Job 19:23,24 point. Heb. nail. graven. Pr 3:3; 7:3; 2Co 3:3 and upon. Le 4:17,18,25; Ho 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-2","title":"Jeremiah 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>their children. 7:18; Ho 4:13,14 their altars. 2:20; Jud 3:7; 2Ch 24:18; 33:3,19; Ps 78:58; Isa 1:29; 17:8 Eze 20:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-3","title":"Jeremiah 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>my. 26:18; Isa 2:2,3; La 5:17,18; Mic 3:12; 4:1,2 I will. 15:13; 52:15-20; 2Ki 24:13; 25:13-16; Isa 39:4-6; La 1:10 Eze 7:20-22 and thy. 12:12; Le 26:30; Isa 27:9; Eze 6:3; 16:39; Mic 1:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-4","title":"Jeremiah 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thyself. Heb. in thyself. shalt. 16:13; 25:9-11; Le 26:31-34; De 4:26,27; 28:25; Jos 23:15,16 1Ki 9:7; 2Ki 25:21 and I. 5:29; 27:12,13; De 28:47,48; Ne 9:28; Isa 14:3 for. 7:20; 15:14; De 29:26-28; 32:22-25; Isa 5:25; 30:33; 66:24; La 1:12 Eze 20:47,48; 21:31; Na 1:5,6; Mr 9:43-49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-5","title":"Jeremiah 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Cursed. Ps 62:9; 118:8,9; 146:3,4; Isa 2:22; 30:1-7; 31:1-9; 36:6 Eze 29:6,7 flesh. 2Ch 32:8; Isa 31:3 whose. Ps 18:21; Isa 59:15; Eze 6:9; Ho 1:2, Heb 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-6","title":"Jeremiah 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>like. 48:6; Job 8:11-13; 15:30-34; Ps 1:4; 92:7; 129:6-8; Isa 1:30 and shall. 2Ki 7:2,19,20; Job 20:17 a salt. De 29:23; Jud 9:45; Eze 47:11; Zep 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-7","title":"Jeremiah 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Ps 2:12; 34:8; 84:12; 125:1; 146:5; Pr 16:20; Isa 26:3,4; 30:18 Eph 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-8","title":"Jeremiah 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he shall. Job 8:16; Ps 1:3; 92:10-15; Isa 58:11; Eze 31:4-10; 47:12 drought. or, restraint. 14:1; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-9","title":"Jeremiah 17:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>16:12; Ge 6:5; 8:21; Job 15:14-16; Ps 51:5; 53:1-3; Pr 28:26; Ec 9:3 Mt 15:19; Mr 7:21,22; Heb 3:12; Jas 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-10","title":"Jeremiah 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the Lord. 11:20; 20:12; 1Sa 16:7; 1Ch 28:9; 29:17; 2Ch 6:30; Ps 7:9 Ps 139:1,2,23,24; Pr 17:3; Joh 2:25; Ro 8:27; Heb 4:12,13; Re 2:23 even. 32:19; Ps 62:12; Mt 16:27; Ro 2:6-8; Re 20:12; 22:12 fruit. 21:14; 32:19; Isa 3:10,11; Mic 7:13; Ro 6:21; Ga 6:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-11","title":"Jeremiah 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>sitteth, etc. or gathered young which she hath not broughtforth. he that. 5:27,28; 22:13,17; Pr 1:18,19; 13:11; 15:27; 21:6; 28:8,16,20,22 Isa 1:23,24; Eze 22:12,13; Ho 12:7,8; Am 3:10; 8:4-6; Mic 2:1,2,9 Mic 6:10-12; 7:3; Hab 2:6-12; Zep 1:9; Zec 5:4; 7:9-13; Mal 3:5 Mt 23:14; 1Ti 6:9; Tit 1:11; Jas 5:3-5; 2Pe 2:3,14 shall leave. Ps 55:23; Pr 23:5; Ec 5:13-16 a fool. Lu 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-12","title":"Jeremiah 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>3:17; 14:21; 2Ch 2:5,6; Ps 96:6; 103:19; Isa 6:1; 66:1; Eze 1:26 Eze 43:7; Mt 25:31; Heb 4:16; 12:2; Re 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-13","title":"Jeremiah 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the hope. 17; 14:8; Ps 22:4; Joe 3:16; Ac 28:20; 1Ti 1:1 all that. 2:26,27; Ps 97:7; Isa 45:16,17; 65:11-14; 66:5; Eze 16:63; 36:32 Da 12:2 they that. 5; Ps 73:27; Pr 14:14; Isa 1:28 written. Pr 10:7; Lu 10:20; Joh 8:6-8; Re 20:15 forsaken. 2:13,17; Ps 36:8,9; Joh 4:10,14; 7:37,38; Re 7:17; 21:6; 22:1,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-14","title":"Jeremiah 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Heal. 31:18; De 32:39; Ps 6:2,4; 12:4; Isa 6:10; 57:18,19; Lu 4:18 save. 15:20; Ps 60:5; 106:47; Mt 8:25; 14:30 thou. De 10:21; Ps 109:1; 148:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-15","title":"Jeremiah 17:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>20:7,8; Isa 5:19; Eze 12:22,27,28; Am 5:18; 2Pe 3:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-16","title":"Jeremiah 17:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I have. 1:4-10; 20:9; Eze 3:14-19; 33:7-9; Am 7:14,15; Jas 1:19; 3:1 to follow thee. Heb. after thee. neither. 4:19,20; 9:1; 13:17; 14:17-21; 18:20; Ro 9:1-3 that. Ac 20:20,27; 2Co 1:12; 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-17","title":"Jeremiah 17:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>a terror. Job 31:23; Ps 77:2-9; 88:15,16 thou. 7,13; 16:19; Ps 41:1; 59:16; Na 1:7; Eph 6:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-18","title":"Jeremiah 17:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>confounded. 20:11; Ps 35:4,26,27; 40:14; 70:2; 83:17,18 but let not me be confounded. Ps 25:2,3; 71:1 the day. 16; 18:19-23 destroy them with double destruction. Heb. break them with adouble breach. 11:20; 14:17; 16:18; Job 16:14; Re 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-19","title":"Jeremiah 17:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>A.M. cir. 3393. B.C. cir. 611. 7:2; 19:2; 26:2; 36:6,10; Pr 1:20-22; 8:1; 9:3; Ac 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-20","title":"Jeremiah 17:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>13:18; 19:3; 22:2; Ps 49:1,2; Eze 2:7; 3:17; Ho 5:1; Am 4:1 Mic 3:1; Re 2:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-21","title":"Jeremiah 17:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Take. De 4:9,15,23; 11:16; Jos 23:11; Pr 4:23; Mr 4:24; Lu 8:18; Ac 20:28 Heb 2:1-3; 12:15,16 bear. 22-27; Nu 15:32-36; Ne 13:15-21; Joh 5:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-22","title":"Jeremiah 17:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>neither do. Ge 2:2,3; Ex 16:23-29; 20:8-10; 23:12; 31:13-17; Le 19:3; 23:3 De 5:12-15; Isa 56:2-6; 58:13; Eze 20:12,20,21; 22:8; Lu 6:5; 23:56 Re 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-23","title":"Jeremiah 17:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>they obeyed. 7:24-26; 11:10; 16:11,12; 19:15; Isa 48:4; Eze 20:13,16,21 Zec 7:11,12; Ac 7:51 made. Pr 29:1 nor. 6:8; 32:33; 35:15; Ps 50:17; Pr 1:3,5; 5:12; 8:10; Zep 3:7 Joh 3:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-24","title":"Jeremiah 17:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>if. Ex 15:26; De 11:13,22; Isa 21:7; 55:2; Zec 6:15; 2Pe 1:5-10 to bring. 21,22 but hallow. Isa 58:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-25","title":"Jeremiah 17:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>shall there. 22:4 sitting. 13:13; 22:30; 33:15,17,21; 2Sa 7:16; 1Ki 9:4,5; Ps 89:29-37 Ps 132:11,12; Isa 9:7; Lu 1:32,33 riding. De 17:16; 1Sa 8:11; 2Sa 8:4 and this. Ex 12:14; Ps 132:13,14; Heb 12:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-26","title":"Jeremiah 17:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>from the cities. 32:44; 33:13; Jos 15:21-63 the plain. Zec 7:7 bringing burnt. Le 1:1-7:38; Ezr 3:3-6,11 sacrifices of. 33:11; Ps 107:22; 116:17; Heb 13:15; 1Pe 2:5,9,10; Re 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-17-27","title":"Jeremiah 17:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>ye will. 24; 6:17; 26:4-6; 44:16; Isa 1:20; Zec 7:11-14; Heb 12:25 to hallow. 21,22; Eze 22:8 then. 4; 21:12,14; 32:29; 38:21-23; 49:27; De 32:22; Isa 9:18,19; La 4:11 Eze 16:41; 20:47,48; Am 1:4,7,10,12,14; 2:2,4,5 shall devour. 39:8; 52:13; 2Ki 25:9; 2Ch 36:19; Am 2:5 shall not. 7:20; 2Ki 22:17; Isa 1:31; Eze 20:47; Mr 9:43-48</p>"}]}